[?1h=
NAME
    Get-ConsoleCapability
    
SYNOPSIS
    Shows what ConsoleMonster detected about the current 
    terminal.
    
    Returns the terminal profile: kind, mode (Interactive, 
    Stream, Plain), colour depth, glyph tier, size, VT 
    support, console font and the reasons behind each 
    decision. -Refresh detects again (after a resize or 
    font change).
    
    
SYNTAX
    Get-ConsoleCapability [-Refresh <SwitchParameter>] 
    [<CommonParameters>]
    
    
DESCRIPTION
    Shows what ConsoleMonster detected about the current 
    terminal.
    
    Returns the terminal profile: kind, mode (Interactive, 
    Stream, Plain), colour depth, glyph tier, size, VT 
    support, console font and the reasons behind each 
    decision. -Refresh detects again (after a resize or 
    font change).
    

RELATED LINKS

REMARKS
    To see the examples, type: "Get-Help 
    Get-ConsoleCapability -Examples"
    For more information, type: "Get-Help 
    Get-ConsoleCapability -Detailed"
    For technical information, type: "Get-Help 
    Get-ConsoleCapability -Full"


